  1147                              <1>     ; AMI counts up to); 30h/31h, the previous POST's count, only if
  1148                              <1>     ; 17h/18h is 0. Before, the larger of the two: after the EMS size was
  1149                              <1>     ; raised, 30h/31h still held the old, larger count and the bar
  1150                              <1>     ; stopped at about 70%. More RAM than configured: bu_mem grows it.
